🧠 Real Insight

👉 Large Java projects use packages extensively for modular development.

Examples:

* Banking systems
* Web applications
* Android apps

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📚 Key Takeaways

✔ Packages organize Java code
✔ Built-in packages provide predefined classes
✔ User-defined packages improve modularity
✔ `import` keyword accesses package classes
✔ Packages prevent naming conflicts


